<title>DUBAI: QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah June cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY-Lufthansa Sharjah June cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, an autonomous unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its latest monthly report on service standards achieved at its Sharjah, United Arab Emirates hub.</p>
<p>The report gives results claimed by Lufthansa Cargo Sharjah for June 1997.</p>
<p>    Customer commitment		    Achievement</p>
<p>    June 1997				     May 1997</p>
<p>Flown as booked</p>
<p>    99 pct					 99 pct</p>
<p>Import cargo ready for pick up</p>
<p>-perishables: one hour after flight arrival</p>
<p>    100 pct				     100 pct</p>
<p>-general: five hours after flight arrival</p>
<p>    100 pct				     100 pct</p>
<p>Export acceptance waiting time</p>
<p>     (up to one tonne:   one hour</p>
<p>one to five tonnes: two hours</p>
<p>five to 10 tonnes:  three hours)</p>
<p>99pct					 97pct</p>
<p>Telephone answered by third ring</p>
<p>83 pct					 85pct</p>
<p>-Dubai newsroom +971-4-6071222</p>
</text>
